//                                   dist 1.065/0.5824/0.0609)
//     C = (1−λL)·ln(e λL^f NLV^g NFr^h) ≥ 0   (uphill seg 0.011/−3.768/3.539/−1.614,
//         uphill int 2.96/0.305/−0.4473/0.0978, uphill dist C = 0,
//         downhill all 4.70/−0.3692/0.1244/−0.5056),  NLV = 1.938 vSL (ρL/σL)^¼
