//     transition: HL = A·HL_seg + (1−A)·HL_int,  A = (L3 − NFr)/(L3 − L2)
//     y = λL/HL²,  S = ln y / (−0.0523 + 3.182 ln y − 0.8725 (ln y)² + 0.01853 (ln y)⁴),
